  [  8] getparam 0 .............................. <tid>
  [ 10] lt ...................................... <the timer < tid>
  [ 11] jmpifz [ 20] ............................ repeat while the timer < tid
  [ 14] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 16] extcall 26 .............................. nothing()
  [ 18] endrepeat [  4]
  [ 20] ret
end

